h(62, 550, """Every soul was created for a mission. Whoever envies does not understand his role in life or why Allah created him!""")

h(62, 1500, """A soul that will surely perish: its owner need only do one thing: envy!""")

h(62, 2300, """How does the one with a wicked soul lay his head on the pillow and sleep?""")

t(63, 330, """When Abu Jahl, seized by anger, said to those who wanted to scale the wall of the house of the Prophet ﷺ: 'And shall the Arabs say that we scaled the walls and violated the privacy of Muhammad's daughters?!'

This is the society of the polytheists 1450 years ago""")

h(63, 800, """In the first Jahiliyyah the challenge was dealing with polytheists, but today dealing with evil people is a greater and harder challenge""")

t(63, 1345, """Psychological deviations show themselves in behavior. The more the psychologically deviant person talks, the more we can be sure of the kind and number of his psychological deviations.
The coming recordings, by the power of Allah the Exalted, will treat the psychological and behavioral methods of the "man of the bench" deluded by fame, in several topics. The first of them will be the alliance of the psychologically deviant with the enemies of his society, for reasons and hidden sides that will be explained to strengthen our awareness of the reality of those around us .. Example: the man of the bench selling his religion and the honor of the word to support the enemies of his Ummah and the enemies of Syria""")

h(63, 1900, """A treasure of psychological deviations has been found! No doubt reviewing the deviant model will serve well in spreading awareness""")

h(64, 300, """When a wretch worships the dollar, it is impossible for him to understand anything recited to his deaf ears""")

t(64, 725, """Then he said: "Shall I not tell you what holds all of that together?" I said: Yes, O Prophet of Allah. So he took hold of his tongue and said: "Restrain this." I said: O Prophet of Allah, will we be held to account for what we say? He said: “May your mother lose you, O Mu'adh! Is there anything that throws people into the Fire on their faces — or on their noses — except the harvest of their tongues?”""")

h(64, 1100, """{Is he who shields himself with his face from the evil punishment on the Day of Resurrection...?! And it is said to the wrongdoers: "Taste what you used to earn"}""")

t(64, 1690, """The coming Gaza, Allah willing, under the second universality of Islam""")

t(65, 60, """… vanishes by the power of our Lord .. Ramadan followed by Ramadan and Eids followed by Eids .. Young men and girls being married .. Women and men .. Children being born .. Banquets to which people are invited .. A new and different world .. From here it is said: This is Jerusalem .. The clock points to nine .. Here is the latest news of mankind .. First item: the proclamation of the Charter of Human Freedom for the first time in 1407 years""")

t(65, 1040, """Tel al-Rabi' .. soon, by the power of Allah""")

t(65, 1900, """When, by the power of our Lord, our dawn rose like a sunrise in which there is no ambiguity, conjecture, illusion or fancy, and their day grew dark""")

t(66, 300, """To everyone who has (worn us out) with wailing and shouting on his channel""")

h(66, 600, """In the time of defeat people are of two kinds: a wailer who, because of events, cries day and night "we will die, we will die", and a tranquil one who sees by the light of Allah the relief and victory that are coming!""")

t(66, 1215, """China stops buying Russian oil.

Comment: Not out of fear of American sanctions.. To push Russia into a clash with the West.

China's benefit, according to the Chinese attempt that will fail strategically.. Keeping the West busy with a Russian-Western conflict in order to seize Taiwan.""")

h(66, 1750, """News and comment!""")

t(66, 2260, """Among humans there are two kinds .. and the same holds for nations .. Trust in iron is a trust .. and trust in Allah is a trust .. I do not believe in iron stripped of the power of Allah .. That people, our enemy, possess strong iron .. but it is the strength of steel .. and the cohesion of the molten material .. We believe in the might of Allah in iron, not the might of the fire that smelts it .. Between us and that people are two promises .. their false promise of their great state and our true promise, by the power of our Lord, of our great state .. And between promise and promise .. between falsehood and truth .. there is speech and there is chatter .. While they chatter from themselves, from their minds, from the offspring of their delusions, from their heedlessness and their wandering in their second-to-last Sinai .. they chatter with the written text of the promises they themselves wove from the depth of their desires, forgetting that the decrees of the Lord are not cut to the measure of their delusions; and between our promise and their written text in which they lied, their nation wakes in the morning to imagine when their lands will expand and the rivers Nile, Euphrates and Tigris will flow beneath their feet.. our Ummah wakes saying: Which construction companies, I wonder, will build in Jerusalem the largest government complex in the world? Our Ummah's government complex from Jerusalem .. Our Ummah wakes neither dreaming nor deluded at all .. while their nation wakes deluded, living on delusions as is their habit.. They wake imagining the inheritance of Egypt, the Levant, Iraq""")

t(67, 60, """and the Arabian Peninsula and our annihilation, and we wake upon the true promise of our Lord and say: Every land, every farm, and every apartment from Galilee to the Red Sea, whose share will it be, I wonder, and who will live in it among the Palestinians, Egyptians, Sudanese, the people of the Maghreb countries, the Arabian Peninsula, the Levant, Iraq, Pakistan, Bangladesh, Arakan, East Turkestan, Turkey, Afghanistan, Malaysia, Indonesia and Iran .. Our Ummah wakes every morning upon a true promise, and their nation wakes every morning upon a delusion they wove from their fancies!""")

h(67, 650, """While .. and while!""")

t(67, 1100, """This is the state of the Ummah; whoever understands has given rest and found rest .. For 2000 years a nation ruled the earth, then perished .. perished by a mouse .. And for hundreds of years nations ruled that were destroyed by Hitler's eruption and rage .. so their iron withdrew from many oppressed lands and nations .. The Umayyads fell, then the Abbasids, then the Ottomans .. The Soviets fell .. A Japan said to be invincible fell .. They all fell by the causes of the earth .. Because the kingdoms of the earth are not a great thing with Allah .. not a huge thing with Him .. They are, sadly, huge and very great only in the minds of some people!""")

h(67, 1650, """Like the people of Musa in helplessness .. an Ummah awaiting seas that swallow .. a sorcery of knowledge that is cut off .. and a lowliness before people that is lifted by aid from Allah!""")

h(67, 2400, """And that every decree must come to pass! So never grieve over its turns, for it neither stalls nor prevents your decree!""")

t(68, 480, """Such is people's life .. full of what is not fixed; the settled and the still are rare in it .. So what world do people cling to, and what did they see in it to love it with all this passion .. Our Lord sends people His signs about the world .. He shows them its realities one after another so they may know it is an abode in which no settling or station holds; it carries them like ships on the seas, which no sooner anchor than they nearly turn back to waves that are at feud and enmity with stillness. Yet the wave was created so, and its nature is not hidden from creation; and the ship likewise was given its balance, and on its way it pays no heed to hardships, knowing it will never sail on dry land; its fate is the waves until its planks are torn off and its funeral goes out. All of us are the ship, and the world is its wave that never leaves it.""")

h(68, 1200, """The sail is hardly ever furled, yet there are winds that leave neither tent nor cauldron!""")

t(68, 1570, """2027, and Allah knows best ... the return of the old tickets""")

t(68, 2455, """Do not forget your brothers in your Sudan""")

h(69, 300, """When will you rest from the horror of war? Peace to you, O wounded homeland""")

t(69, 860, """Although this talk that circulates among people has been answered several times, some brothers and sisters still insist on "making themselves miserable", speaking of the imminent extinction of the Arabs and that the coming years are the years of the Arabs' extinction, though I have replied to this matter here more than once and said that extinction is not what is coming in the coming years. I repeat again: those who spread among people the idea of the extinction of the Arabs in the coming years did not grasp the hadiths of sound chain nor ponder them; they passed over them without understanding. And when they pondered the hadiths of extinction, because the time of extinction is mixed with the appearance of the Dajjal, they supposed that the extinction of the Arabs comes before the Dajjal. Nor did they consider that the Arabs are two, not one: there are the pure Arabs, and there are the Arabized in the Levant and North Africa, and these are not pure Arabs. I do not like to delve much into this matter because it changes nothing .. So let us leave behind the spirit of psychological defeat, the spirit of accumulated frustration, the spirit of despondency, the spirit of despair and the spirit of seeing the future as blackness, grief and distress .. Let us leave behind these traits and this despairing spirit, sad in its present, and which even when it meets the future meets it with sadness, despair and frustration. All this is the work of ignorant owners of pulpits and microphones who misled the Arabs, frightened them and frustrated them.

Our Prophet ﷺ speaks of the Ummah's affair growing great; how can an Ummah grow great whose people have perished and of whom only a few remain? Whose word do we take? The word of the ignorant, or a hadith of sound chain as in the picture?!""")

t(69, 1590, """- "At the end of my Ummah the Mahdi will come forth; Allah will give him rain, the earth will bring forth its plants, he will give wealth out evenly, livestock will multiply, the Ummah will grow great; he will live seven, or eight."

Summary of the hadith scholar's ruling: Its chain is sound""")

h(69, 2400, """Under capitalism, you want to sell the most expensive goods in the poorest country in the world?! Yes, a successful project, and you will sell!""")

t(70, 515, """I saw the seventies .. It was the seventies
By the power of Allah, our Great Lord""")

h(70, 900, """The question that never stops! The most repeated: Will electricity remain after the 3? Yes .. I saw everything working except the network!""")

h(70, 1800, """The ruins of the infrastructure the Soviets left behind are a thousand times cleaner than third world countries!""")

h(71, 200, """The number 7 is his fate forever .. It dominates the owner of the greatest fitnah in history .. 70 thousand follow him! Where did the 15.8 million go?! Tell me! Where did they go!""")

h(71, 900, """The harshest face of a miserable life is a barren desert and hot weather! But if our Lord wills, He gives a man of the Ummah rain wherever he wishes and likes""")

t(71, 1500, """In the coming years, by the permission of Allah the Exalted, the Sahara and the Arabian desert will disappear and will have a green cover; the high temperatures will disappear and the weather will become mild""")

h(71, 2000, """The Sahara and the Arabian desert will witness, by the power of Allah, a historic climate change!""")

h(72, 350, """Despite all the weeping and frustration of our generation, tomorrow it will thank Allah the Great for creating it in this time!""")

t(72, 775, """International experts: Any American-Chinese military conflict will set the two countries back many years!""")

h(72, 1150, """International experts are now repeating the obvious! Good morning!""")

t(72, 1690, """In the assassination of the collective consciousness of the peoples of third world countries, the people of those advanced countries were portrayed as the greatest in skill, the highest in morals and the most good; added to these labels, which cannot be generalized, they were described as having the greatest love of work .. Among the poor peoples collective notions formed that shattered the self-confidence of the son of the third, fourth and fifth world. This affected how the individual belonging to these three low categories views his home, his street, his clothes, his appearance, his food, his thinking, his planning and his dealings with others: his wife .. his children .. his relatives .. his colleagues.. his rivals at work .. Then, when he sees the son of the first world, he became shaken inside and weak, sensing that one's superiority clearly and openly!""")

h(72, 2300, """Being Japanese, European or South Korean does not mean he is an angel walking the earth!""")

t(73, 220, """Between the guillotine of poverty in countries collapsing from poverty and the anvil of individual differences in society — in awareness, understanding and the will to realize the goodness of the soul — poverty always strikes the mind, the soul and the spirit with continuous blows like unceasing waves. The human soul in a state of material stability is calmer and more balanced, circumstantially and momentarily, but it does not become a good soul merely because poverty has left its world. That is why crimes exist whether in the European Union, Japan or South Korea, where living standards are insured by the state against possible and expected poverty. So obtaining a secure life is not a drive toward building the goodness of society's members. Poverty makes morals worse, and money calms the soul but does not produce goodness.""")

h(73, 800, """Social behavior is rooted in man's mind, awareness and will, but poverty drives its distortion to take root and grow worse""")

t(73, 1330, """The leaders of the Batini sects are always agents and traitors, not sometimes""")

h(73, 1750, """The dervish-like Batini sects are a great danger to the future of the Ummah""")

h(73, 2400, """The drying up of the sources is near! No further comment on the celebration of the green and red colors""")
